{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对音乐细部变化的捕捉不如Y细，尤其是分时出现的声音变化、情绪转折和尾声呼应，Y更有层次。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的左右分栏让人比较容易先抓住人物正在经历什么，再顺手感受音乐如何映照心情；完整句子也把害怕负担、收住喜欢、重新获得勇气等心理因果交代得更自然。Y的关键词放大和分时感受有优势，尤其能抓住一些细微的音乐变化，但部分感受词近义重复、意象切换较多，容易让注意力从人物故事转移到逐条辨认感受。整体听下来，X更容易让普通观众持续跟住一个人的心路变化，Y则在局部音乐细节上更精细。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "24f8ddf2-7e0a-4b06-96da-2eed8a3bd291", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000956186587Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:10:56.407884+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "02689440efaad14822e9f92e1a601828e521c838d4c9c5463e4de17ea9e8cd04", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_